### Get all classifiers
GET https://localhost:7178/api/v1/classify/classifiers
Accept: application/json

### Create a new classifier
POST https://localhost:7178/api/v1/classify/classifiers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "schemeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "slug": "draft",
  "label": "Draft",
  "properties": "{}",
  "sortOrder": 1
}

### Get classifier by ID
GET https://localhost:7178/api/v1/classify/classifiers/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000010
Accept: application/json

### Get classifier by slug
GET https://localhost:7178/api/v1/classify/classifiers/slug/draft
Accept: application/json

### Get classifier by scheme and slug
GET https://localhost:7178/api/v1/classify/classifiers/scheme/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/slug/draft
Accept: application/json

### Update a classifier
PUT https://localhost:7178/api/v1/classify/classifiers/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000010
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "draft",
  "label": "Draft Updated",
  "properties": "{ \"color\": \"blue\" }",
  "sortOrder": 2
}

### Delete a classifier
DELETE https://localhost:7178/api/v1/classify/classifiers/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000010
Accept: application/json
